//                                      --------------  QBREAKPOINT  --------------
// * breakpoint ek pre-defined screen width hoti h jispe webpage ka layout different screen ya different device pr ke 
//   according adjust hota he(breakpoint is a pre-defined screen width on which the layout of the webpage adjusts according
//   to different screens or different devices)
// * breakpoint se responsive design create krte h jisse content ko phone, tablet, desktop pe dekhne pr bhi ek accha view
//   dikhta h(breakpoints create responsive designs in which the content looks good even when viewed on phones, tablets, 
//   desktops)
// * example -> xs < 576px, sm >= 576px, md >= 768px, lg >= 992px, xl >= 1200px, xxl >= 1400px


